# Party chat test (docs/re-party-chat.md), run with --save on a party-chat build: Jeff's story flags plus
# 0x193 (been to Perit Village) poked in Jian's room, then a warp into Perit Village (map 166). The
# Perit-only vanilla line ("That's why we came here to Perit Village") plays there.
include boot_from_save
wait 30
poke u32 0x02204620 0x10103806
poke u32 0x02204650 0x000E0000
pin u16 0x020B77EC 166
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
peek u16 0x020B8056 figures_flags
shot perit_icon_0
wait 4
shot perit_icon_4
press Y 3
wait 150
shot perit_y1
press A 3
wait 120
shot perit_y2
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 60
peek u16 0x020B8056 figures_flags_after
shot perit_after_0
wait 4
shot perit_after_4
